"""
Connectors of `Machinery.OnOffConsumer`, without any equation. Parameter-preset wrappers
extend this, hold one `OnOffConsumer` as `core` and connect both ports to it.
"""
partial component OnOffConsumerPorts
  "On/off command: 1 = on, 0 = off"
  WorkSignal = RealInput()
  "Electrical power drawn [W]"
  y = RealOutput()
end
